  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Page No.# 1/3 vs The State Of Assam And Anr on 30 October, 2024 Author: Malasri Nandi",
    "facts": "By this application under Section 528 of BNSS, the petitioner has prayed for quashing and setting aside the order dated 07.11.2019 for taking cognizance under Section 26(1), 26(2)(i) of the Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006 and any subsequent order passed by the learned Chief Judicial Magistrate, Tinsukia in CR Case No. 95/2019. However, a copy of the petition along with the documents annexed thereto be furnished to him. It is submitted by learned counsel for the petitioner that on 22.11.2018 when the Food Inspector visited the premises of the company, the petitioner Nos. 1 and 2 were not in service. It is further submitted that the petitioner No.1 resigned from the company on 16.08.2016 and petitioner No.2 had been retired from service on 22.06.2016. In view of the above, learned senior counsel for the petitioner prayed to stay further proceeding of the case.",
